{"id":"661639","name":"鱼骨煮粉","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/661639/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鱼骨","amount":"200g"},{"name":"米粉","amount":"1块"},{"name":"芹菜","amount":"2根"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"1块"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鱼头吃完了，剩下几块鱼骨用来煮粉，材料有鱼骨、米粉、芹菜。","img":"images/661639/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鱼骨用盐、淀粉、酱油腌制入味。","img":"images/661639/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"芹菜切碎粒，切点姜丝去腥。","img":"images/661639/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"米粉倒入清水泡发20分钟。","img":"images/661639/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起锅热油，放入鱼骨。","img":"images/661639/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/661639/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入姜丝炒香。","img":"images/661639/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入清水，最好是开水，汤更浓白。","img":"images/661639/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"五分钟后，汤已煮至奶白。","img":"images/661639/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入米粉煮1~2分钟。","img":"images/661639/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入盐和胡椒粉调味。","img":"images/661639/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"最后撒上芹菜叶出锅。","img":"images/661639/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661639/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。肉质嫩滑，汤汁鲜美，配上芹菜叶一绝。","img":"images/661639/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}